Operator, ell=0 restriction, collective BCs, and harmonic profiles
------------------------------------------------------------------
  CONSUMED/POSTULATED operator: Lop[alpha] = muEta^(-1)*(-d_w(Tw*d_w alpha) + K_eta*alpha) on w in [0,L0].
  Alias for projection only: K_eta = Tw*beta^2; beta = sqrt(K_eta/Tw) is the cited wall-packet relation.
  Notation guard: domain length is L0; operator applications are named Lop_alpha_a and Lop_alpha_L.
  ell=0 restriction: Y00=1/(2*sqrt(pi)); int_S2 Y00^2 dOmega=1; eta(w,t)=eta_00(w,t)*Y00; T_Omega drops because ell*(ell+1)=0.
  Inner product: <f,g>_mu = 4*pi*int_0^L0 muEta*f*g dw.
  IMPOSED collective BCs: alpha_a(0)=1, alpha_a(L0)=0; alpha_L(0)=0, alpha_L(L0)=rAL.
  General solution form = C1*Sinh[beta*w] + C2*Cosh[beta*w].
  DSolveValue alpha_a = Csch[beta*L0]*Sinh[beta*(L0 - w)]
  DSolveValue alpha_L = rAL*Csch[beta*L0]*Sinh[beta*w]
PASS  alpha_a equals reported harmonic-lift profile
PASS  alpha_L equals reported harmonic-lift profile
PASS  Lop_alpha_a harmonic residual is zero
PASS  Lop_alpha_L harmonic residual is zero
PASS  BC alpha_a(0)=1
PASS  BC alpha_a(L0)=0
PASS  BC alpha_L(0)=0
PASS  BC alpha_L(L0)=rAL

M_AB/K_AB by native int-dw operator projection
----------------------------------------------
  M integrands:
    aa: muEta*Csch[beta*L0]^2*Sinh[beta*(L0 - w)]^2
    aL: muEta*rAL*Csch[beta*L0]^2*Sinh[beta*(L0 - w)]*Sinh[beta*w]
    LL: muEta*rAL^2*Csch[beta*L0]^2*Sinh[beta*w]^2
  K integrands:
    aa: beta^2*Tw*Cosh[2*beta*(L0 - w)]*Csch[beta*L0]^2
    aL: -(beta^2*rAL*Tw*Cosh[beta*(L0 - 2*w)]*Csch[beta*L0]^2)
    LL: beta^2*rAL^2*Tw*Cosh[2*beta*w]*Csch[beta*L0]^2
  M_AB = <|"aa" -> (muEta*Pi*Csch[beta*L0]^2*(-2*beta*L0 + Sinh[2*beta*L0]))/beta, "aL" -> (2*muEta*Pi*rAL*(-1 + beta*L0*Coth[beta*L0])*Csch[beta*L0])/beta, "LL" -> (muEta*Pi*rAL^2*Csch[beta*L0]^2*(-2*beta*L0 + Sinh[2*beta*L0]))/beta|>
  K_AB = <|"aa" -> 4*beta*Pi*Tw*Coth[beta*L0], "aL" -> -4*beta*Pi*rAL*Tw*Csch[beta*L0], "LL" -> 4*beta*Pi*rAL^2*Tw*Coth[beta*L0]|>
  det(M) = (-4*muEta^2*Pi^2*rAL^2*(-1 + beta^2*L0^2*Csch[beta*L0]^2))/beta^2
  det(K) = 16*beta^2*Pi^2*rAL^2*Tw^2
PASS  M_aa matches report closed form
PASS  K_aa matches report closed form
PASS  M_aL matches report closed form
PASS  K_aL matches report closed form
PASS  M_LL matches report closed form
PASS  K_LL matches report closed form
PASS  det(M) matches report closed form
PASS  det(K) matches 16*pi^2*Tw^2*beta^2*rAL^2
