Dynamical EOM LHS only
----------------------
  Q = (delta_a, delta_L); Qddot = (delta_a_ddot, delta_L_ddot).
  EOM structure: M_AB*Qddot^B + K_AB*Q^B = F_A^(HF).
  RHS placeholders: F_a_HF, F_L_HF are deferred to stage 015; no Hellmann-Feynman force is computed here.
  row a LHS = (2*Pi*Csch[beta*L0]*(-(rAL*(deltaLddot*muEta + 2*beta^2*deltaL*Tw)) + (deltaAddot*muEta + 2*beta^2*deltaA*Tw)*Cosh[beta*L0] + beta*L0*muEta*(-deltaAddot + deltaLddot*rAL*Cosh[beta*L0])*Csch[beta*L0]))/beta = F_a_HF
  row L LHS = (2*Pi*rAL*Csch[beta*L0]*(-(deltaAddot*muEta) - 2*beta^2*deltaA*Tw + rAL*(deltaLddot*muEta + 2*beta^2*deltaL*Tw)*Cosh[beta*L0] + beta*L0*muEta*(-(deltaLddot*rAL) + deltaAddot*Cosh[beta*L0])*Csch[beta*L0]))/beta = F_L_HF
PASS  EOM has exactly two LHS rows
PASS  EOM RHS is symbolic placeholder only

